{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24313","headline":"春来频与李二宾客郭外同游因赠长句 · 白居易","name":"春来频与李二宾客郭外同游因赠长句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风光引步酒开颜，送老消春嵩洛间。\n朝蹋落花相伴出，暮随飞鸟一时还。\n我爲病叟诚宜退，君是才臣岂合闲。\n可惜济时心力在，放教临水复登山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24313.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24313","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}